infinite-patch 1
# Future Garage Sub Chord Organ Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 48
  i note1 48
  i note2 51
  i note3 55
  i note4 48
  i note5 51
  i note6 58
  i note7 55
  i note8 48
  i note9 48
  i note10 51
  i note11 53
  i note12 48
